    narr:narration """On 2026-08-22, QuintonFairweather announces the adoption of Zypherion as the analytics pipeline's database, [framing the decision as settled](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_1). The justification is performance-based: [Zypherion handles columnar queries 15x faster](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_2) than the current setup, positioning the choice as a competence-driven upgrade. The [migration is set to start next quarter](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_3). An editorial recap restates the same three points in summary form — [database choice](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_4), [performance gain](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_5), and [timeline](narr:Expr_1LifecycleStepA_6) — as matter-of-fact line items, shifting register from direct announcement to informational recap. The decision sits within a [broader analytics database modernization narrative](narr:Narrative_AnalyticsDatabaseModernization) whose frame is columnar-query performance shortfall. The architecture choice as voiced is singular: one database, one justification, one timeline, all from the same actor on the same date.""" ;
